d Flow.\n\nTired of tunnel restarts every time you tweak a setting? Tunna lets you change nodes, update rules, and modify configurations on the fly. Your connection stays live. Your workflow stays smooth.\n\n⌘ Multi-Node Muscle: Beyond Basic Split Tunneling.\n\nThis is where things get interesting. Tunna allows you to bind different rules to different nodes, simultaneously.\n• Implement advanced split tunneling with ease.\n• Go further and split traffic across multiple nodes based on your rules. Stream through one, browse through another – all at the same time. It’s about giving you the power to route traffic exactly how you envision.\n\n⌘ Battery-Friendly by Design.\n\nA powerful proxy shouldn't kill your battery. Tunna is optimized for efficiency, especially during device sleep. It respects system states, so you get the power without the drain.\n\n⌘ Management, Simplified.\n\nJuggling multiple proxy managed lists? Tunna provides a clean interface to manage and switch between them effortlessly.\n\nTunna is for those who need more than just a toggle switch. It’s for users who want to command their connection, optimize their routes, and demand a stable, flexible, and efficient proxy experience on iOS. If that sounds like you, give Tunna a spin.","rating":4.8,"ratingCount":"6","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=6471652937&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=886412125"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"6471652937"},{"locationPosition":2,"locationType":"lockup","name":"Tunna","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"6471652937"},{"locationPosition":8,"locationType":"similarItems","name":"You 